/*!

*\page del Del (Delete file or directory)
*
* This instruction is used to delete a file or multiple files using <*> or deleting a directory.
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
* *  <span style='color:blue'>del  <FN> </span> 		 : delete file <FN>
* *  <span style='color:blue'>del  <*> </span> 			 :  delete all files and directories
* *  <span style='color:blue'>del  <DIR> </span> 		 : delete file directory.
*
*
* <span style='color:green'><strong>Note:</strong></span><br>
* An SD-card module must be connected to the Nucleo board through SPI, with an SD card inserted. The card must be mounted before using this instruction.
*/
